abstract: >-
  Randomized Linear Algebra Library. A unified,
  multi-language library implementing randomized algorithms
  for low-rank matrix factorizations. Provides efficient
  randomized-sketching-based methods for large-scale matrix
  factorizations with consistent APIs across Python,
  MATLAB/Octave, and Julia.
